{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2022-10-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'DENVER , OCT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON NOVEMBER 18, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 7, 2022.'}